DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmall.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jd.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pinduoduo.com,DIRECT

# ⚠️ 闲鱼/得物这类建议不要强制 DIRECT（容易绕规则体系）
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,idlefish.com,DIRECT
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dewu.com,DIRECT


